  "body": "[vca~] is a mono (one in/out) VCA. It is the basis of the [vca.m~] MERDA module. For convenience, it sums polyphonic (multichannel connections) inputs into a single channel by default. You also have a general gain compensation and a right output to feed a [vu] object. Yeah, not much different than just using [*~]."
